# 云服务枚举与发现

## 子域名接管
```bash
# CNAME 指向云服务但已删除原资源
# 常见可接管场景：
bucket.s3.amazonaws.com        # S3 桶被删除
target.cloudfront.net           # CloudFront 被删除
target.trafficmanager.net       # Azure Traffic Manager
target.cname.aliyuncs.com       # 阿里云 OSS/CNAME
```

## 云服务指纹识别
```bash
# IP/域名反查云服务商
whois IP | grep -i "amazon\|alibaba\|microsoft"

# HTTP 响应头指纹
x-oss-request-id        # 阿里云 OSS
x-amz-request-id        # AWS
via: 11 cdn.xxx.com     # CDN
```

## 云存储桶枚举
```bash
# 常见命名模式
{company}-backup
{company}-static
{company}-assets
{company}-files
{company}-dev
{company}-prod
{company}-images
{company}-uploads
{company}-config
{company}-data

# 工具
s3scanner -o bucket.txt  # S3
aliyun-oss-bucket-scanner
cloud_enum -k company-name
```

## 云 API/端口
```bash
# Docker
2375/2376: Docker API
# Kubernetes
6443: K8s API
10250: Kubelet API
# 云数据库（云厂商托管）
# 需结合 AK/SK 或特定网络访问
```

